Name: Google Lighthouse
Short Name: lighthouse
URL: https://github.com/GoogleChrome/lighthouse
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Version: 12.4.0
Revision: HEAD
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
Forks:
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/lighthouse
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/lighthouse

Description:
Automated auditing, performance metrics, Accessibility (WCAG 2.2 AA/AAA), Best Practices, and SEO engine for Chromium web applications.

Local Modifications:
- Integrated as a native Bun.plugin (yolo-bun:lighthouse) and zero-overhead HTML/HTTP response auditor in packages/yolo-bun-plugin.
- Evaluates Performance, Accessibility, Best Practices, and SEO categories with deterministic 100/100 gates.
